---
import ToolLayout from '@/layouts/ToolLayout.astro';

const howToSteps = [
  { name: 'Välj uppgift', text: 'Skriv in vilken uppgift du ska fokusera på i fältet ovanför timern.' },
  { name: 'Sätt 25-minuters timer', text: 'Klicka på Starta för att sätta igång 25-minuterstimern.' },
  { name: 'Ta 5 minuters paus', text: 'Ta en kort paus på 5 minuter när timern larmar. Var fjärde session ges en längre paus på 15–30 minuter.' },
  { name: 'Upprepa cykeln', text: 'Starta nästa fokussession och upprepa. Klockan håller automatiskt reda på sessioner och pauser.' },
];
---
<ToolLayout
  slug="pomodoro"
  title="Pomodoroklocka online — 25/5 Pomodoro-tekniken | Klocka.com"
  description="Gratis pomodoroklocka för fokus och produktivitet. 25 minuter arbete, 5 minuter paus."
  howToSteps={howToSteps}
>
  <Fragment slot="intro">
    <p>Starta timern, arbeta i 25 minuter utan avbrott, ta en kort paus — sen om igen. Pomodoro-tekniken hjälper dig att fokusera och undvika prokrastinering.</p>
    <p>Klocka.com erbjuder en gratis pomodoro-timer online — starta direkt utan inloggning.</p>
  </Fragment>

  <div slot="tool">
    <!-- Task name -->
    <div class="pom-task-row">
      <label class="pom-task-label" for="pomTask">Uppgift</label>
      <input
        type="text"
        id="pomTask"
        class="pom-task-input"
        placeholder="Vad ska du jobba med?"
        autocomplete="off"
        maxlength="80"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Phase badge -->
    <div class="pom-phase-row">
      <span class="pom-badge" id="pomBadge" data-phase="focus">Fokus</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Timer -->
    <div class="pom-timer" id="pomTimer" role="timer" aria-live="off">25:00</div>

    <!-- Cycle dots -->
    <div class="pom-dots" id="pomDots" role="group" aria-label="Sessionsprogress: 0 av 4 sessioner klara">
      <span class="pom-dot" data-i="0"></span>
      <span class="pom-dot" data-i="1"></span>
      <span class="pom-dot" data-i="2"></span>
      <span class="pom-dot" data-i="3"></span>
    </div>

    <!-- Controls -->
    <div class="pom-controls">
      <button id="pomStart" class="btn btn-primary pom-start" aria-label="Starta pomodorotimern">Starta</button>
      <button id="pomSkip"  class="btn btn-ghost" aria-label="Hoppa över nuvarande fas">Hoppa över</button>
      <button id="pomReset" class="btn btn-ghost" aria-label="Återställ timern">Återställ</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Mute toggle -->
    <div class="pom-mute-row">
      <button id="pomMute" class="pom-mute-btn" aria-pressed="false">Ljud på</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Settings -->
    <details class="settings-panel">
      <summary class="settings-toggle">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
          <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 19.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/>
        </svg>
        Inställningar
      </summary>
      <div class="settings-grid">
        <label class="setting-field">
          <span class="setting-label">Fokus (min)</span>
          <input type="number" id="pomFocusDur" min="1" max="90" value="25" class="setting-input" aria-label="Fokustid i minuter" />
        </label>
        <label class="setting-field">
          <span class="setting-label">Kort paus (min)</span>
          <input type="number" id="pomShortDur" min="1" max="30" value="5" class="setting-input" aria-label="Kort pauslängd i minuter" />
        </label>
        <label class="setting-field">
          <span class="setting-label">Lång paus (min)</span>
          <input type="number" id="pomLongDur" min="5" max="60" value="15" class="setting-input" aria-label="Lång pauslängd i minuter" />
        </label>
        <label class="setting-field">
          <span class="setting-label">Sessioner</span>
          <input type="number" id="pomSessions" min="2" max="8" value="4" class="setting-input" aria-label="Antal fokussessioner per lång paus" />
        </label>
      </div>
    </details>

    <p class="shortcuts-hint">
      <kbd>Space</kbd> starta/pausa &nbsp;·&nbsp;
      <kbd>→</kbd> hoppa över &nbsp;·&nbsp;
      <kbd>Esc</kbd> återställ
    </p>

    <!-- ARIA live region for phase announcements -->
    <p id="pomStatus" class="sr-only" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></p>
  </div>

  <Fragment slot="content">
    <h2>Vad är Pomodoro-tekniken?</h2>
    <p>
      Pomodoro-tekniken är en tidshanteringsmetod skapad av Francesco Cirillo på slutet av 1980-talet. Namnet
      kommer från den tomatformade kökstiduret han använde som student. Metoden bygger på ett enkelt
      mönster: arbeta fokuserat i 25 minuter (ett "pomodoro"), ta sedan en kort paus på 5 minuter. Var fjärde
      session ersätts den korta pausen av en längre rast på 15–30 minuter.
    </p>
    <p>
      Forskning kring fokus och kognition visar att hjärnan presterar bättre när arbete bryts upp i avgränsade
      block med obligatoriska återhämtningsperioder. Den tickande timern skapar också ett litet
      tryck — en känsla av att man "racear mot klockan" — som kan motverka prokrastinering och hålla
      koncentrationen uppe.
    </p>
    <p>
      Klocka.coms pomodoroklocka hanterar sessionsräkning och pausbyten automatiskt. Du behöver inte hålla
      reda på om det är en kort eller lång paustur — klockan vet det. Allt du behöver göra är att välja vad
      du ska jobba med och trycka Starta.
    </p>
  </Fragment>
</ToolLayout>

<style>
  .pom-task-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
  .pom-task-label {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .pom-task-input {
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    min-height: 44px;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .pom-task-input:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 1px;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .pom-phase-row {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .pom-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px var(--space-4);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 12%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    transition: background var(--transition-base), color var(--transition-base);
  }
  .pom-badge[data-phase="shortBreak"] {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-success) 12%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-success);
  }
  .pom-badge[data-phase="longBreak"] {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #7c3aed 12%, transparent);
    color: #7c3aed;
  }

  .pom-timer {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 14vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1;
    text-align: center;
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-4);
    transition: color var(--transition-base);
  }
  .pom-timer[data-running="true"][data-phase="focus"]      { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .pom-timer[data-running="true"][data-phase="shortBreak"] { color: var(--color-success); }
  .pom-timer[data-running="true"][data-phase="longBreak"]  { color: #7c3aed; }

  .pom-dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
  .pom-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .pom-dot.done {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pom-dot.current {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: scale(1.4);
  }

  .pom-controls {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .pom-start { min-width: 110px; }

  .pom-mute-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .pom-mute-btn {
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), background var(--transition-fast);
    min-height: 36px;
  }
  .pom-mute-btn:hover { background: var(--color-surface-2); color: var(--color-ink); }
  .pom-mute-btn[aria-pressed="true"] { opacity: 0.55; }

  .settings-panel {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .settings-toggle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    padding: var(--space-1) 0;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .settings-toggle:hover { color: var(--color-ink); }
  .settings-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .settings-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(130px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .setting-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-1); }
  .setting-label {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .setting-input {
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    min-height: 44px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .setting-input:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 1px;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .shortcuts-hint {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
  }
  kbd {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    background: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px; height: 1px;
    padding: 0; margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0);
    white-space: nowrap; border-width: 0;
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    type Phase = 'focus' | 'shortBreak' | 'longBreak';

    const timerEl    = document.getElementById('pomTimer')    as HTMLElement | null;
    const badgeEl    = document.getElementById('pomBadge')    as HTMLElement | null;
    const dotsEl     = document.getElementById('pomDots')     as HTMLElement | null;
    const startBtn   = document.getElementById('pomStart')    as HTMLButtonElement | null;
    const skipBtn    = document.getElementById('pomSkip')     as HTMLButtonElement | null;
    const resetBtn   = document.getElementById('pomReset')    as HTMLButtonElement | null;
    const muteBtn    = document.getElementById('pomMute')     as HTMLButtonElement | null;
    const taskInput  = document.getElementById('pomTask')     as HTMLInputElement  | null;
    const statusEl   = document.getElementById('pomStatus')   as HTMLElement | null;
    const focusIn    = document.getElementById('pomFocusDur') as HTMLInputElement  | null;
    const shortIn    = document.getElementById('pomShortDur') as HTMLInputElement  | null;
    const longIn     = document.getElementById('pomLongDur')  as HTMLInputElement  | null;
    const sessionsIn = document.getElementById('pomSessions') as HTMLInputElement  | null;

    if (!timerEl || !badgeEl || !startBtn || !skipBtn || !resetBtn || !muteBtn) return;

    const dots = dotsEl ? Array.from(dotsEl.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.pom-dot')) : [];
    const PAGE_TITLE = document.title;

    let phase: Phase = 'focus';
    let remainingSec = 25 * 60;
    let sessionsDone = 0;
    let running = false;
    let muted = false;
    let rafId: number | null = null;
    let lastTs: number | null = null;

    function getSettings() {
      return {
        focusSec:           Math.max(1, Number(focusIn?.value    ?? 25)) * 60,
        shortSec:           Math.max(1, Number(shortIn?.value    ?? 5))  * 60,
        longSec:            Math.max(5, Number(longIn?.value     ?? 15)) * 60,
        sessionsBeforeLong: Math.max(2, Number(sessionsIn?.value ?? 4)),
      };
    }

    function ding(count: number) {
      if (muted) return;
      try {
        const Ctor = window.AudioContext ?? (window as typeof window & { webkitAudioContext?: typeof AudioContext }).webkitAudioContext;
        if (!Ctor) return;
        const ctx = new Ctor();
        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
          const tBase = ctx.currentTime + i * 0.45;
          [659.25, 880].forEach((freq, fi) => {
            const osc = ctx.createOscillator();
            const gain = ctx.createGain();
            osc.connect(gain);
            gain.connect(ctx.destination);
            osc.type = 'sine';
            osc.frequency.value = freq;
            const onset = tBase + fi * 0.13;
            gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0, onset);
            gain.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(0.28, onset + 0.02);
            gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, onset + 0.4);
            osc.start(onset);
            osc.stop(onset + 0.4);
          });
        }
      } catch { /* ignore — audio blocked by browser policy */ }
    }

    function fmt(s: number): string {
      const m = Math.floor(s / 60);
      const ss = s % 60;
      return `${String(m).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(ss).padStart(2, '0')}`;
    }

    const LABELS: Record<Phase, string> = {
      focus:      'Fokus',
      shortBreak: 'Paus',
      longBreak:  'Lång paus',
    };

    function announce(msg: string) {
      if (!statusEl) return;
      statusEl.textContent = '';
      requestAnimationFrame(() => { statusEl.textContent = msg; });
    }

    function renderTimer() {
      const t = fmt(remainingSec);
      timerEl!.textContent = t;
      timerEl!.setAttribute('data-phase', phase);
      timerEl!.setAttribute('data-running', String(running));
      timerEl!.setAttribute('aria-label', `${LABELS[phase]}: ${t}`);
      document.title = running
        ? `${t} · ${LABELS[phase]} — Pomodoroklocka | Klocka.com`
        : PAGE_TITLE;
    }

    function renderBadge() {
      badgeEl!.textContent = LABELS[phase];
      badgeEl!.setAttribute('data-phase', phase);
    }

    function renderDots() {
      const { sessionsBeforeLong } = getSettings();
      dots.forEach((d, i) => {
        d.style.display = i < sessionsBeforeLong ? '' : 'none';
        const done    = i < sessionsDone;
        const current = !done && running && phase === 'focus' && i === sessionsDone;
        d.classList.toggle('done',    done);
        d.classList.toggle('current', current);
      });
      if (dotsEl) {
        const { sessionsBeforeLong: n } = getSettings();
        dotsEl.setAttribute('aria-label', `Sessionsprogress: ${sessionsDone} av ${n} sessioner klara`);
      }
    }

    function render() {
      renderTimer();
      renderBadge();
      renderDots();
      startBtn!.textContent = running ? 'Pausa' : 'Starta';
    }

    function advancePhase() {
      const { focusSec, shortSec, longSec, sessionsBeforeLong } = getSettings();
      if (phase === 'focus') {
        sessionsDone++;
        if (sessionsDone >= sessionsBeforeLong) {
          phase = 'longBreak';
          remainingSec = longSec;
        } else {
          phase = 'shortBreak';
          remainingSec = shortSec;
        }
      } else if (phase === 'shortBreak') {
        phase = 'focus';
        remainingSec = focusSec;
      } else {
        phase = 'focus';
        remainingSec = focusSec;
        sessionsDone = 0;
      }
    }

    function stopLoop() {
      running = false;
      if (rafId !== null) { cancelAnimationFrame(rafId); rafId = null; }
      lastTs = null;
    }

    function loop(ts: number) {
      if (!running) return;
      if (lastTs === null) lastTs = ts;
      const elapsed = Math.floor((ts - lastTs) / 1000);
      if (elapsed >= 1) {
        remainingSec = Math.max(0, remainingSec - elapsed);
        lastTs = ts - ((ts - lastTs) % 1000);
        renderTimer();
        if (remainingSec <= 0) {
          stopLoop();
          const dingCount = phase === 'focus' ? 2 : 1;
          advancePhase();
          render();
          ding(dingCount);
          announce(LABELS[phase] + ' — ' + fmt(remainingSec));
          return;
        }
      }
      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
    }

    function start() {
      if (running) return;
      running = true;
      lastTs = null;
      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
      render();
    }

    function pause() {
      stopLoop();
      render();
      document.title = PAGE_TITLE;
    }

    function skip() {
      const wasRunning = running;
      stopLoop();
      advancePhase();
      if (wasRunning) {
        running = true;
        lastTs = null;
        rafId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
      }
      render();
    }

    function reset() {
      stopLoop();
      phase = 'focus';
      sessionsDone = 0;
      remainingSec = getSettings().focusSec;
      document.title = PAGE_TITLE;
      render();
    }

    // Persist task name across reloads
    const TASK_KEY = 'pom_task_v1';
    if (taskInput) {
      const saved = localStorage.getItem(TASK_KEY);
      if (saved) taskInput.value = saved;
      taskInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
        localStorage.setItem(TASK_KEY, taskInput!.value);
      });
    }

    // Mute toggle
    muteBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      muted = !muted;
      muteBtn!.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(muted));
      muteBtn!.textContent = muted ? 'Ljud av' : 'Ljud på';
    });

    // Buttons
    startBtn.addEventListener('click', () => (running ? pause() : start()));
    skipBtn.addEventListener('click', skip);
    resetBtn.addEventListener('click', reset);

    // Settings change resets timer
    [focusIn, shortIn, longIn, sessionsIn].forEach(el =>
      el?.addEventListener('change', reset),
    );

    // Keyboard shortcuts
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      const tag = (document.activeElement as HTMLElement)?.tagName;
      if (tag === 'INPUT' || tag === 'TEXTAREA' || tag === 'SELECT') return;
      if (e.code === 'Space')       { e.preventDefault(); running ? pause() : start(); }
      else if (e.code === 'ArrowRight') { e.preventDefault(); skip(); }
      else if (e.code === 'Escape') { e.preventDefault(); reset(); }
    });

    // Init
    reset();
  })();
</script>
